    "identifier": "jinzo-synthetic-art-thousand-snake-pile",
    "description": "<p>Your jaw unhinges as your mouth stretches open releasing a countless number of snakes overwhelming all creatures in range, forming a sea of serpents, burying them. All creatures in range must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, the snakes swarm, cover and bite them dealing 2d12 Piercing and 2d12 Poison damage, coating them with 2 ranks of Doused, and leaving them in a Stupor. On a success, affected creatures only take half damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d12 for each damage type.</p>",
